## 🔹 Key Logic

* Add when expanding
* Remove when shrinking
* Maintain condition efficiently

---

## 🔹 Time Complexity

* O(n) (each element enters and leaves once)

---

## ⚠️ Mistakes I Made

* Forgot to shrink window
* Used nested loops → O(n²)
* Didn’t update result correctly
* Confused when to shrink

---

## 🎯 Key Insight

Sliding window works when:

* Subarray/substring
* Continuous elements
* Need optimization from brute force

